'''The Huns Esports''' is a [[:Category:Mongolia|Mongolian]] esports organization founded in October 2023.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4
|content1=
* October 21st - '''The Huns Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with the [[Tsogoo]], [[nin9]], [[sk0R]], [[Bart4k]] and [[ncl]] as coach. <ref name="huns-enter date">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref><ref name="huns-enter">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=725569502936010|date=2023-10-24|title=One of Top 6 teams of MPS Fall, The Huns Esports|author=[[MESA]]}}</ref>
* November 15th - '''The Huns Esports''' acquire [[yAmi]] from [[ATOX Esports]]. <ref name="+yAmi">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=122119038746084351|date=2023-11-15|title=Introducing our V player - Welcome, yAmi!|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 10th - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[Tsogoo]]. <ref name="-tsogoo">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* February 20th - '''The Huns Esports''' sign [[cobrazera]]. <ref name="+cobra">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* May 1st - '''The Huns Esports''' add [[Tamiraarita]] as a stand-in. <ref name="+tamiraarita">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* September 21st - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[sk0R]] and [[Tamiraarita]]. <ref name="-sk0r-tamir">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=122176999250084351|date=2024-09-21|title=Roster Update: Farewell to sk0R and Tamiraarita|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 6th - '''The Huns Esports''' sign [[wonderzce]] from [[IHC Esports]] and acquire [[xerolte]] from [[Chinggis Warriors]]. <ref name="+wonderzce">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* December 10th - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[wonderzce]] and sign [[Veccil]]. <ref name="+veccil">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>

|content3=
* March 10th - '''The Huns Esports''' sign [[yAmi]] from [[IHC Esports]] while [[xerolte]] leaves the team. <ref name="+yami">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* April 1st - '''The Huns Esports''' bench [[Veccil]] and re-sign [[xerolte]]. <ref name="April 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/1907090392467771439|date=2025-01-04|title=Veccil will be benched effective immediately|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* May 15th - [[IHC Esports]] acquire [[Veccil]]. <ref name="ihc 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ihc_esports/status/1922941074143625255|title=As we head into the final stretch of 2025, here are our updated rosters for the rest of the season|date=2025-05-15|author=[[IHC Esports]]}}</ref>
* June 19th - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[ncl]] and bench [[yAmi]]. <ref name="-ncl">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/1935575380238508087|title=Thank you, ncl|date=2025-06-19|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="bench yAmi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/1935602413517570187|title=Saying goodbye to yAmi|date=2025-06-19|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 11th - '''The Huns Esports''' acquire [[sk0R]] from [[Eruption]] and sign [[carnage]] as their new coach. <ref name="+sk0R 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/1943650142764064899|title=He's back!|date=2025-07-11|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+carnage">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/1943619024241242321|title=Welcome, cArnage!|date=2025-07-11|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 10th - [[yAmi]] is acquired by [[IHC Esports]]. <ref name="ihc +yami again">{{inside source|source=Timothy}}</ref>
* December 31st - [[cobrazera]] is acquired by [[The MongolZ]]. <ref name="-cobra">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2006390416372031562|title=THANK YOU AND GOODBYE, COBRA|date=2025-12-31|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="mongolz cobra">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/1mongolz/status/2006399375556378918|title=The Roster is Locked|date=2025-12-31|author=[[The MongolZ]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 6th - '''The Huns Esports''' acquire [[controlez]] from [[Chinggis Warriors]]. <ref name="+controlez">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2008478781850480875|title=Welcome, controlez|date=2025-01-06|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* June 4th - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[sk0R]]. <ref name="-sk0r">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2062462385043218528|title=Thank you, sk0R|date=2025-06-04|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* June 5th - '''The Huns Esports''' part ways with [[xerolte]]. <ref name="-xerolte">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2062796720799682997|title=Thank you, xerolte|date=2025-06-05|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* June 15th - '''The Huns Esports''' sign [[ANNIHILATION]]. <ref name="+ANNIHILATION">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2066438161610473501|title=Welcome, Annihilation|date=2025-06-15|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 5th - [[nin9]] is acquired by [[The MongolZ]]. <ref name="-nin9">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/thehunsesports/status/2107003612291584489|title=Farewell, nin9|date=2026-10-05|author='''The Huns Esports'''}}</ref>
}}

